# =============================================================================
# .trivyignore — Trivy vulnerability exceptions
#
# These CVEs have no fix available from Debian at time of writing.
# Status: affected / fix_deferred — no patched package exists.
# Review monthly and remove entries once Debian releases fixes.
#
