# GnuPG: Stack-based buffer overflow in tpm2daemon
# Status: affected (no Debian fix)
# Impact: Low — tpm2daemon not used in container workloads
CVE-2026-24882

# glibc: Denial of Service via iconv() function
# Status: fix_deferred (Debian tracking, no release yet)
CVE-2026-4046

# ncurses: Buffer overflow vulnerability
# Status: affected (no Debian fix)
# Impact: Low — ncurses not exposed to untrusted input in our containers
CVE-2025-69720

# nghttp2: Denial of Service via malformed HTTP/2
# Status: affected (no Debian fix)
CVE-2026-27135

# systemd: Arbitrary code execution or DoS
# Status: affected (no Debian fix)
# Impact: Low — systemd runs as init in host, not in container workloads
CVE-2026-29111
